---
description: API conventions (frontend requests & backend route handlers)
globs: *.tsx,*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
Frontend → backend requests: use @tanstack/react-query (useQuery/useMutation) with axios.
Do not call fetch ad-hoc in components.

Backend endpoints: Next.js App Router route handlers at src/app/api/**/route.ts.
We DO NOT use next-api-decorators or class-validator (removed).

Compose handlers from the HOFs in src/lib/api-handlers.ts:
- withAuth({ mode, roles? })  — auth gate, injects `user`
- withValidation(zodSchema, "body" | "query")  — validates input with Zod, injects `body`
- withTeamGuard()  — verifies team membership, injects `team`
- pipe(...wrappers)(handler)  — compose right-to-left
- json(data) / apiError.{unauthorized,forbidden,badRequest,notFound,internal} for responses

Validate every body/query input with a Zod schema. ctx.params is a Promise: `await ctx.params`.
DB access only via `import { prisma } from "@/services/prisma"`.
